<Majesty>
	<SteamWorkshop id="0" visibility="Private">
		<Title lang="en_US">Majesty Mod Manager</Title>
		<Description lang="en_US">Choose your Majesty Gold HD mods in one place, safely combine supported custom guild mods, manage compatible quality-of-life improvements, and launch through the runtime those mods need.

The app finds local and subscribed content, sorts it into Merge, Standard, Quests, and Quality of Life, enables compatible mods by default, and remembers later choices. Standard mods stay independent and downloaded quests remain untouched.

Selected manager-compatible CAM mods are combined into one validated local package. Unknown conflicts are shown in red and cannot be selected instead of silently allowing one mod to overwrite another.

Supports Default Public 1.5.2.24 and beta2 1.5.2.28. Current private-preview Merge support covers Custom Guild: Phantoms Haunt and Custom Guild: Alchemist Lab. The included Haunt compatibility edition keeps the stock Elf Guild intact.

Subscribe, open this item's Workshop folder, keep the entire download together, and run Majesty Mod Manager.exe. Install the two required helpers when prompted, prepare selected Merge mods, then use Launch Majesty.

This unsigned community app may trigger Windows SmartScreen. Source, documentation, and licenses:
https://github.com/Phantomstar721/majesty-gold-hd-cam-merger</Description>
		<ContentPath>dist\workshop-upload\content</ContentPath>
		<PreviewImagePath>dist\workshop-upload\workshop-preview.jpg</PreviewImagePath>
